  "document": "Lester Bronson\nLester Daniel Bronson (December 23, 1905 – January 24, 1972) was a Democrat and represented Nome, Alaska as a member of Alaska territorial House of Representatives 2nd District, 1955-56; in the 1st Alaska State Legislature as a Senator 1959-1960; 2nd Alaska State Legislature as a Senator 1961-1962; 3rd Alaska State Legislature 1963-1965 as a Senator and in the 6th Alaska State Legislature"
